[{"sha":"c9e7223f0a96837ce5ef60ee4179050694a40c26","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGM5ZTcyMjNmMGE5NjgzN2NlNWVmNjBlZTQxNzkwNTA2OTRhNDBjMjY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/c9e7223f0a96837ce5ef60ee4179050694a40c26","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/c9e7223f0a96837ce5ef60ee4179050694a40c26","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-30T08:18:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-30T08:18:50Z"},"tree":{"sha":"154848fbbf758c9261570f2d5863d7883621d299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/154848fbbf758c9261570f2d5863d7883621d299"},"message":"integration: retry transient docker network ops\n\nLibnetwork endpoint cleanup is eventually consistent. A back-to-back\ndisconnect+connect on the same network can race teardown and return a\ntransient error. Wrap the daemon calls in bounded exponential backoff\nso TestHASubnetRouterFailoverDockerDisconnect no longer flakes on\nphase 4c reconnect.\n\nFixes #3234","parents":[{"sha":"3d5c0af4e703482aff8f979ff5bde330a7bf97f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/3d5c0af4e703482aff8f979ff5bde330a7bf97f5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/3d5c0af4e703482aff8f979ff5bde330a7bf97f5"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"b1c0e80b31f30f19d605d50c72318a0f038e704a","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGIxYzBlODBiMzFmMzBmMTlkNjA1ZDUwYzcyMzE4YTBmMDM4ZTcwNGE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b1c0e80b31f30f19d605d50c72318a0f038e704a","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b1c0e80b31f30f19d605d50c72318a0f038e704a","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-30T08:22:59Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-30T08:22:59Z"},"tree":{"sha":"e9f0e00464b69b734634998139d970d3a249dbf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/e9f0e00464b69b734634998139d970d3a249dbf1"},"message":"integration: skip subpackage tests in workflow generator\n\nThe generator scans `integration/` recursively for `Test*` functions\nand emits one CI job per match. Helper subpackages like\n`dockertestutil` and `tsic` host plain unit tests that should run\nunder `go test`, not as Docker-based integration matrix entries.\nLimit the scan to depth 1 so only top-level `integration/*_test.go`\nfiles contribute job names.","parents":[{"sha":"c9e7223f0a96837ce5ef60ee4179050694a40c26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/c9e7223f0a96837ce5ef60ee4179050694a40c26","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/c9e7223f0a96837ce5ef60ee4179050694a40c26"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"34dec533ba6129aa6eaa7bb365bad2902af32955","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDM0ZGVjNTMzYmE2MTI5YWE2ZWFhN2JiMzY1YmFkMjkwMmFmMzI5NTU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/34dec533ba6129aa6eaa7bb365bad2902af32955","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/34dec533ba6129aa6eaa7bb365bad2902af32955","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-30T08:39:31Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-30T08:39:31Z"},"tree":{"sha":"02952f47c05f7ebcf310533c28573821b76b0892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/02952f47c05f7ebcf310533c28573821b76b0892"},"message":"state: per-goroutine deadline in HA probe cycle\n\n`time.After(ProbeTimeout)` returned a single channel shared by every\nprobe goroutine in the cycle. Only the first goroutine to receive the\ndeadline tick drains the channel; any other goroutine still waiting on\nits `responseCh` is then stuck forever, `wg.Wait()` never returns, and\nthe scheduler loop in `app.go` stalls on the next tick. The condition\nfires whenever two or more nodes time out in the same cycle — common\nunder cable-pull where IsOnline lags reality and both routers stay in\nthe candidate set as half-open TCP.\n\nMove the timer inside each goroutine so every probe has its own\ndeadline.\n\nUpdates #3234","parents":[{"sha":"b1c0e80b31f30f19d605d50c72318a0f038e704a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b1c0e80b31f30f19d605d50c72318a0f038e704a","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b1c0e80b31f30f19d605d50c72318a0f038e704a"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"6bd7b42941327f76acdf0095ac3f000de427f11a","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDZiZDdiNDI5NDEzMjdmNzZhY2RmMDA5NWFjM2YwMDBkZTQyN2YxMWE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/6bd7b42941327f76acdf0095ac3f000de427f11a","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/6bd7b42941327f76acdf0095ac3f000de427f11a","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-30T09:01:46Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-30T09:01:46Z"},"tree":{"sha":"514ba3c79bf792bee3a121359e51791ebe13d3e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/514ba3c79bf792bee3a121359e51791ebe13d3e1"},"message":"integration: drop Force flag on docker network disconnect\n\nForce-disconnect leaves stale routes in the container's network\nnamespace: libnetwork removes the host-side veth but the\nnamespace-internal route survives. The next ConnectNetwork on the\nsame network then fails with \"cannot program address X/16 in sandbox\ninterface because it conflicts with existing route\", and the route\nnever resolves on its own. Bounded retry around ConnectNetwork\nexhausts MaxElapsedTime instead of recovering.\n\nWithout Force, libnetwork drains the namespace routes synchronously\nduring disconnect and ConnectNetwork sees a clean slate. Cable-pull\nsemantic is preserved: docker still tears down the endpoint at the\nnamespace level, leaving in-flight TCP half-open inside the\ncontainer's view, verified via paired probe-timeout pairs in HA\nprober logs while both routers are physically disconnected.\n\nFixes #3234","parents":[{"sha":"34dec533ba6129aa6eaa7bb365bad2902af32955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/34dec533ba6129aa6eaa7bb365bad2902af32955","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/34dec533ba6129aa6eaa7bb365bad2902af32955"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":25031321597,"node_id":"RFRE_lADOEFLz888AAAABA6rIrc8AAAAF0_un_Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/25031321597","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"ready_for_review","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-04-30T11:24:08Z",